      "Provide repeatable training and accessible counter-species before the League.",
      "No hidden player stat penalties, unlimited trainer bag items, or impossible abilities.",
      "Prefer team synergy and coverage over requiring level-100 grinding.",
      "Side quests supply optional exploration and training; capture quests are optional; required main-story tasks and all twenty Gyms lead to the final N battle.",
      "Gen 5 types and mechanics only; no Fairy type or later-generation species."
    ]
