    "Do not invent EV data that vanilla trainer records do not store.",
    "Set AI flags by known semantics; do not enable every bit.",
    "Preserve unrelated battle scripts, NPC names and original dialogue; make only explicitly recorded changes necessary for Champion N, the N/Alder arc and the pre-finale access rules.",
